  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Haiti - Institutional Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a capacity building project aims to support Caritas Haiti in developing and implementing its new strategic plan, which will reinforce the national and the diocese offices, and enable them to fulfil their role more effectively.
This will be achieved through strengthening the Monitoring and Evaluation Unit and the sub-section on Disaster Risk Reduction which resulted from the new Institutional and Organisational Development Strategy (DIRO) for 2011-2015. This strategy aims to improve the measurement of the impact of activities implemented by the network and enhance its response in future emergencies. 
The project includes the recruitment of staff, training, field visits and provision to create simple monitoring tools and a database for the management of projects.</narrative>
  </description>
